1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,670
(All characters, places,
and organizations are fictional.)

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:03,270
(Children and teens were filmed
under production guidelines.)

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,110
(Episode 12)

4
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:14,990
Mother?

5
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:19,990
How did you...

6
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:23,930
Da Mi told me.

7
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,770
You must be getting off work now.

8
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:29,830
Yes.

9
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:35,910
Let us sit down for a bit.

10
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,420
Are you happy?

11
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,490
Are you? I asked if you are happy.

12
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,000
Your mother is here asking you,
so why can you not say anything?

13
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:00,900
Tell me.

14
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,540
Get it off your chest and tell me.

15
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,680
Mother.

16
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:18,680
Mother.

17
00:01:19,450 --> 00:01:20,820
Doesn't your palm hurt?

18
00:01:21,450 --> 00:01:22,450
It hurts.

19
00:01:23,590 --> 00:01:25,620
But my heart hurts even more.

20
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:29,890
Who will comfort my mother now?

21
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,160
I don't know.

22
00:01:33,870 --> 00:01:36,130
I need to take care
of my own feelings first.

23
00:01:37,670 --> 00:01:39,770
I ran out because
I felt like I was going to die.

24
00:01:42,110 --> 00:01:43,140
He...

25
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:48,310
needs to know how to stand
on his own two feet, Mother.

26
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:52,520
From now on,
you need to think differently...

27
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:53,790
about that issue as well.

28
00:01:56,050 --> 00:01:57,820
Then, Mi Seon, are you saying...

29
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:01,730
that you decided to get a divorce
to make our Gang Nam grow up?

30
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,630
Are you saying I spoiled him?

31
00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:08,500
I just wanted you two
to have an easier start...

32
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:10,440
because I suffered so much.

33
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,270
That's why I bought you a house,

34
00:02:12,370 --> 00:02:13,510
and when you lacked cash
while working,

35
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:15,140
my only crime was giving you cash.

36
00:02:16,670 --> 00:02:19,640
I only ever gave to you,
and I never rubbed it in your faces,

37
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:21,250
nor did I ask for anything back.

38
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:24,350
What parent in the world
who can make a decent living...

39
00:02:24,450 --> 00:02:25,580
wouldn't do at least that much?

40
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:30,050
I only ever helped you
with your lives,

41
00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:32,290
so what did I do wrong?

42
00:02:34,330 --> 00:02:35,360
Mother.

43
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:39,600
What? Tell me. Say it all.

44
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:42,930
Didn't you come here
to give me side dishes?

45
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:45,270
I did. But...

46
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,870
Then why are you
getting so worked up?

47
00:02:47,970 --> 00:02:49,040
It's all in the past.

48
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:51,710
Please don't be angry.

49
00:02:52,540 --> 00:02:53,850
Mother,
even if you don't do this, I...

50
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,350
I already feel incredibly sorry
toward you.

51
00:03:05,290 --> 00:03:07,060
Da Mi said there's a game of Yut...

52
00:03:07,130 --> 00:03:09,860
happening at home today,
so aren't you too late?

53
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:14,070
Look at me. I should take a taxi.

54
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:20,670
Do not skip your meals,
and change the lock on that door.

55
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,440
How can you use it
when it is so dangerous?

56
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:27,450
It is fine, Mother. I have money.

57
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:30,280
Change the lock right away.
Do you understand?

58
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,180
I will come by again.

59
00:03:48,930 --> 00:03:49,930
Bless her heart.

60
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,620
Hey, you have been drawing
for years,

61
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,680
and you still cannot draw?

62
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:08,420
Then you draw it.

63
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:09,890
Why would I...

64
00:04:09,950 --> 00:04:11,190
(Mi Seon)

65
00:04:18,330 --> 00:04:20,060
What is going on?

66
00:04:20,130 --> 00:04:21,330
(Su Ah's Dad)

67
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:23,400
How is Su Ah?

68
00:04:24,570 --> 00:04:27,010
Now? You are finally curious now?

69
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:29,140
Did you feed her dinner?

70
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,640
Yes.

71
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:34,510
Why did you call?

72
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:37,550
Mother came by.

73
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,720
And...

74
00:04:41,350 --> 00:04:43,520
And what else?

75
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:45,260
I heard there is
a Yut board game today.

76
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,760
So?

77
00:04:47,490 --> 00:04:48,560
Handle it well.

78
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,060
What?

79
00:04:51,130 --> 00:04:53,160
Explain things well
to Grandma and Mother.

80
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:56,200
You are being ridiculous.

81
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:58,140
Explain what well?

82
00:04:58,740 --> 00:04:59,740
Everything.

83
00:05:00,670 --> 00:05:03,070
Since you were divorced by me
and moved back to your family home,

84
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,810
you must be feeling
a bit embarrassed.

85
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:07,280
Up until now...

86
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:08,850
you must have been thinking
about things.

87
00:05:08,910 --> 00:05:10,580
Explain that well to them.

88
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:13,450
You are funny,
considering we split up.

89
00:05:13,790 --> 00:05:15,350
You are not my wife anymore.

90
00:05:15,790 --> 00:05:17,720
So why are you telling me
to explain things well?

91
00:05:18,590 --> 00:05:22,330
Besides, I do not have
any thoughts right now.

92
00:05:23,630 --> 00:05:24,700
Is that something to be proud of?

93
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:27,770
Are you proud of having no thoughts?

94
00:05:28,130 --> 00:05:29,930
- Hey...
- Then you should at least...

95
00:05:30,030 --> 00:05:31,240
listen carefully
to what the elders say.

96
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:33,400
Take good care of Su Ah.

97
00:05:39,780 --> 00:05:42,110
This woman, seriously.

98
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:45,350
Does she still think
she can control me?

99
00:05:45,650 --> 00:05:49,050
- Who is it, Dad? Is it Mom?
- What?

100
00:05:50,290 --> 00:05:51,290
Well...

101
00:05:53,930 --> 00:05:55,430
It is Mom, Su Ah.

102
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:59,930
You should have let me talk to her.
I want to hear Mom's voice.

103
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,630
Mom is working right now,

104
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,340
so she must have called
during a short break.

105
00:06:04,900 --> 00:06:07,170
She just called to ask
if you are doing well.

106
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,640
Okay.

107
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:16,050
Hey, it was you, right?

108
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,550
You are the messenger, right?

109
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,320
She said Mother went over there,

110
00:06:21,850 --> 00:06:24,020
so you must be the one
stuck in the middle.

111
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,920
What if I am?

112
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:30,430
Where does she live?

113
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:32,830
Mi Seon said that even if I tell
everyone else in the family,

114
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:35,000
I should never tell you.

115
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,400
What?

116
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:39,370
Was that not your first phone call
since she left home?

117
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:42,770
You should have been nicer.
Look at your attitude on the phone.

118
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:45,380
Did you always treat her
so grumpily like that?

119
00:06:46,780 --> 00:06:49,480
Yes, you deserved it.

120
00:06:49,850 --> 00:06:52,180
This girl, seriously. Hey.

121
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,750
Hey, what do you know
about married life?

122
00:06:55,250 --> 00:06:56,950
What do you know
about relationships...

123
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,820
to be acting so high
and mighty with me?

124
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:03,830
Why are you all bickering?
Before the Yut board is even set up.

125
00:07:05,060 --> 00:07:06,130
What is this, Auntie?

126
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,570
Can you not tell?

127
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,070
Is this your first time
seeing a red basin?

128
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,400
I mean...

129
00:07:10,870 --> 00:07:16,240
- Why are you bringing it out?
- The In-law said to pour it.

130
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:19,410
Pour? Pour what?

131
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:21,750
I finished drawing it.

132
00:07:23,450 --> 00:07:24,450
What is this?

133
00:07:27,450 --> 00:07:31,420
How many bottles is this?
Who is Grandma...

134
00:07:31,490 --> 00:07:32,760
trying to drink
under the table today?

135
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,460
I am not hiding anything, Auntie.

136
00:07:36,990 --> 00:07:38,430
Tell me about it.

137
00:07:38,530 --> 00:07:41,230
It does not seem like
you are the target.

138
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:44,700
Why are you looking at me, Auntie?
It is not me either.

139
00:07:44,770 --> 00:07:47,100
I am completely innocent.

140
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:51,110
Auntie, I cannot drink alcohol.
So what do I drink?

141
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:55,080
I will give our Su Ah
some banana milk later.

142
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:58,480
Su Ah, do not come anywhere near
this basin.

143
00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,780
Okay.

144
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:03,820
It is not you,
and it is not you either, Da Mi.

145
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,490
Could it be him?

146
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:11,060
Dae Chi? Hey, do you know something?

147
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,630
Me? I do not know.

148
00:08:15,470 --> 00:08:19,000
Hey, by the way, is your Mom
here or not?

149
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,570
Is she closing up the shop?

150
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,180
Hey, Assistant Manager Park.

151
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:32,320
Is this really the best you can do?
I am so grateful for your help.

152
00:08:33,220 --> 00:08:35,720
But with 15,000 dollars,
I just cannot...

153
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,290
Manager Kang,

154
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:39,990
I completely understand
your situation.

155
00:08:40,590 --> 00:08:42,030
The money I sent you...

156
00:08:42,430 --> 00:08:45,560
came from a bumper harvest
of flawless chili peppers.

157
00:08:45,730 --> 00:08:47,570
My mother-in-law gave it to me
without telling my wife...

158
00:08:47,630 --> 00:08:49,730
and split it equally
among her sons-in-law.

159
00:08:50,770 --> 00:08:51,770
You have three months.

160
00:08:52,170 --> 00:08:55,110
Use it for just three months
and you must return it, okay?

161
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:57,980
I understand your complicated story.

162
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,910
But Assistant Manager Park,
can you really not do more?

163
00:09:01,210 --> 00:09:02,250
I have to feed the baby,

164
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:03,680
so I will hang up first,
Manager Kang.

165
00:09:04,550 --> 00:09:06,680
Why did you side with Kim Pro?

166
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,620
You should have listened
when I tried to stop you.

167
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,690
Hey, Assistant Manager Park. Park...

168
00:09:13,990 --> 00:09:15,290
Tell me about it.

169
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:18,300
You should have tried harder
to stop me.

170
00:09:23,770 --> 00:09:25,770
CEO Jeon, what is this?

171
00:09:26,470 --> 00:09:27,610
Open it, Assistant Manager Kang.

172
00:09:31,310 --> 00:09:33,180
A hotel fitness pass...

173
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,750
Why are you giving this to me...

174
00:09:34,950 --> 00:09:38,420
Assistant Manager Kang, you helped
our company, and especially me.

175
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:40,520
Please take this as a small token...

176
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:42,190
for your dedication.

177
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,760
I have been using it
for a few years,

178
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:47,290
and the facilities and staff
are the best.

179
00:09:48,660 --> 00:09:49,960
Thank you, CEO Jeon,

180
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:53,360
but I only did what I was
supposed to do.

181
00:09:54,230 --> 00:09:58,470
Besides, you are the person
I respect the most.

182
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,310
This gift is too much for me.

183
00:10:01,470 --> 00:10:02,870
I will gratefully accept
the sentiment.

184
00:10:03,470 --> 00:10:05,380
I will be disappointed
if you refuse.

185
00:10:07,010 --> 00:10:08,780
The way I see it,
Assistant Manager Kang,

186
00:10:09,310 --> 00:10:10,720
you are just as ambitious...

187
00:10:10,780 --> 00:10:12,780
about your work
as I was in my youth.

188
00:10:13,580 --> 00:10:15,820
I recognized that the moment
you joined the company.

189
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:18,920
I do not mean for you
to go to the hotel...

190
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:20,360
just to exercise.

191
00:10:21,430 --> 00:10:25,830
You should build ties naturally
over time with people who go there.

192
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:29,030
Oh, right.

193
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,940
Our Do Yun is there every dawn too.

194
00:10:32,370 --> 00:10:33,640
No matter how busy he is,

195
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:35,140
he makes sure to go
at least three days a week...

196
00:10:35,210 --> 00:10:36,470
to work out.

197
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:41,050
Go ahead and take it.
It is time to get off work.

198
00:10:42,310 --> 00:10:44,150
Yes, thank you, CEO Jeon.

199
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:56,130
Sorry I am late, Mother.

200
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:57,560
(Mi Mi's Chicken Soup)

201
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,700
Did you see her?

202
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:01,900
Yes.

203
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,100
How is she doing?

204
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,440
About the same.

205
00:11:08,740 --> 00:11:11,610
Her already-thin waist
has gotten even thinner,

206
00:11:12,410 --> 00:11:13,740
so now it is not even a handful.

207
00:11:15,710 --> 00:11:17,920
I could not even enter
her rooftop room, Mother.

208
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,980
She would not let me in.

209
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,520
I am sorry.

210
00:11:24,420 --> 00:11:27,120
If she was willing to come back,
you would have brought her.

211
00:11:27,930 --> 00:11:28,930
Besides,

212
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:31,960
how can you stop someone
who can leave on their own?

213
00:11:33,630 --> 00:11:35,500
I am so upset.

214
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:39,040
Even if you are upset,
do not blame Mi Seon.

215
00:11:39,670 --> 00:11:42,040
It is our fault
for raising our son poorly,

216
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:45,980
and taking in someone else's
dear child only to make her suffer,

217
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,750
and making her leave
on her own two feet...

218
00:11:47,850 --> 00:11:48,880
It is all our fault.

219
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,020
We just did not see it.

220
00:11:51,850 --> 00:11:53,820
The tears Mi Seon shed
before she left...

221
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:56,190
must have filled 3 or 4 buckets.

222
00:11:57,660 --> 00:12:00,020
Still, seeing her face
just made me feel disappointed.

223
00:12:01,090 --> 00:12:02,360
How could she leave
without discussing it,

224
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,530
leaving her young child behind?

225
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:05,900
I feel quite resentful.

226
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,270
Well...

227
00:12:09,070 --> 00:12:10,700
That is because you are her in-law.

228
00:12:12,170 --> 00:12:13,870
Are the kids all gathered?

229
00:12:15,610 --> 00:12:16,840
Go on inside first.

230
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,540
I will turn off the register
and be right in.

231
00:12:31,860 --> 00:12:33,790
I am sorry,
we are closing early today...

232
00:12:34,730 --> 00:12:35,730
Well...

233
00:12:36,060 --> 00:12:37,060
Welcome.

234
00:12:37,660 --> 00:12:40,600
- Are you closed?
- Yes.

235
00:12:40,660 --> 00:12:42,130
Due to family matters,
we had to close...

236
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,330
two hours early today.

237
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,240
I am sorry.

238
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:47,710
It seems you have not
had dinner yet.

239
00:12:47,870 --> 00:12:50,540
It is fine.
I will come back next time.

240
00:12:51,110 --> 00:12:53,340
But excuse me,

241
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,250
if it is a family matter,

242
00:12:55,710 --> 00:12:58,320
is the elder sick or something?

243
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:01,550
No, we have a family gathering.

244
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,890
We rarely close early.

245
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,920
I see. Well then.

246
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:08,590
Take care.

247
00:13:08,830 --> 00:13:10,260
Please make sure
to visit us next time.

248
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,260
Yes, I will.

249
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,300
Oh, you do not have to...

250
00:13:20,370 --> 00:13:21,610
I...

251
00:13:37,020 --> 00:13:43,030
(Mi Mi's Chicken Soup, Closed)

252
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:54,910
So this is...

253
00:13:55,210 --> 00:13:57,740
a membership for the fitness center
where CEO Jeon's son,

254
00:13:57,810 --> 00:13:59,780
Team Leader Cha, works out, Ye Ri?

255
00:14:01,710 --> 00:14:04,550
But is this not a five-star hotel?

256
00:14:05,650 --> 00:14:07,890
CEO Jeon called you in person
and gave this to you as a gift?

257
00:14:07,950 --> 00:14:10,520
Yes, I told you.
On top of that, Mom,

258
00:14:10,790 --> 00:14:13,790
she even casually let me know
when Team Leader Cha works out.

259
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:15,190
Really?

260
00:14:16,090 --> 00:14:18,800
Oh my, she is blatantly
setting the stage...

261
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:21,370
for you two to date.
Start going from tomorrow.

262
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:22,970
By the way,
do you have workout clothes?

263
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:24,030
Should we buy a new set?

264
00:14:26,170 --> 00:14:28,770
Let us go buy some.
I will buy them for you.

265
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:31,040
- But Ye Ri.
- Yes?

266
00:14:31,810 --> 00:14:35,210
Why is the CEO of your company
trying to set you up...

267
00:14:35,850 --> 00:14:37,510
with her son?

268
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:39,280
What do you mean?

269
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:41,350
It is because anyone can see that
our Ye Ri is pretty and capable,

270
00:14:41,420 --> 00:14:43,950
and she is obviously...

271
00:14:44,090 --> 00:14:45,120
the best daughter-in-law material.

272
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:47,190
Why are you asking
such an obvious question?

273
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:50,430
I know she is pretty and capable,

274
00:14:51,060 --> 00:14:53,360
but our family backgrounds
are too different.

275
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:55,130
Usually, people like them...

276
00:14:55,670 --> 00:14:57,130
try to arrange marriages
for their children...

277
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,940
with families of similar status.
Is that not a given?

278
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:01,740
Do you not think it is strange?

279
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:03,170
CEO Jeon is not...

280
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,580
- that kind of person, Dad.
- Exactly.

281
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:08,580
She is clearly very open-minded
about those things.

282
00:15:09,010 --> 00:15:11,420
It is so old-fashioned
to care about family backgrounds.

283
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,420
All that matters is that the person
is smart and capable.

284
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:15,520
Do not be intimidated, Ye Ri.

285
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,590
And you, stop ruining the mood.

286
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:23,030
It is still strange.
I find it incredibly strange.

287
00:15:37,540 --> 00:15:38,640
You are here, Ma'am?

288
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,250
Why are you standing there?
Why not take it inside?

289
00:15:42,050 --> 00:15:43,680
Well...

290
00:15:45,220 --> 00:15:46,520
What is going on?

291
00:15:47,450 --> 00:15:49,250
It would be better
if you do not go in, Ma'am.

292
00:15:56,030 --> 00:15:57,630
(K Department Store)

293
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:00,500
Do Yun.

294
00:16:01,100 --> 00:16:05,200
How much is your monthly salary?
How much is your annual income...

295
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,570
that you buy clothes
worth thousands of dollars...

296
00:16:07,770 --> 00:16:10,170
and bags worth tens of thousands
of dollars at the department store?

297
00:16:10,870 --> 00:16:11,880
I am sorry, Grandma.

298
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:15,110
If you know your sister is immature,

299
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:18,520
teach her to value 10 dollars
like 100 dollars.

300
00:16:18,580 --> 00:16:20,950
That is what an older brother does.

301
00:16:21,220 --> 00:16:23,850
Instead, you play along
with her antics...

302
00:16:23,950 --> 00:16:27,090
and let that naive girl
swipe your credit card?

303
00:16:27,860 --> 00:16:29,830
Is that what
your parents taught you?

304
00:16:31,330 --> 00:16:35,130
Grandma. Do Yun didn't know either.

305
00:16:35,430 --> 00:16:36,830
Do Yun told me
to return everything, so...

306
00:16:37,030 --> 00:16:38,900
I was planning to do it tomorrow.

307
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:41,570
It's all my fault.

308
00:16:41,810 --> 00:16:46,110
- Please let it go this once, okay?
- Some things can't just be let go.

309
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:49,310
Se Na, you have never earned...

310
00:16:49,350 --> 00:16:51,420
even ten dollars
with your own hands.

311
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:55,020
How could you be so reckless
as to take someone else's card...

312
00:16:55,150 --> 00:16:57,550
and spend tens
of thousands of dollars?

313
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:01,430
Do Yun isn't just anyone, Grandma.

314
00:17:01,860 --> 00:17:03,630
Then is it your card?

315
00:17:04,630 --> 00:17:06,830
Were you going to earn the money
to pay it back?

316
00:17:07,630 --> 00:17:10,630
Even if we live under the same roof
and eat together,

317
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:14,610
everyone has to earn their own keep.

318
00:17:16,770 --> 00:17:18,540
Are you ever going to pull
a stunt like this again?

319
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:24,010
Do you want to see
me change my will?

320
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:27,450
I'm sorry, Grandma.
I won't let this happen again.

321
00:17:32,020 --> 00:17:33,060
Me too.

322
00:17:33,690 --> 00:17:35,260
Please forgive me, Grandma.

323
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:38,730
You ungrateful brats.

324
00:17:41,330 --> 00:17:44,330
If you ever do this again,

325
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:46,740
no questions asked,

326
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:49,270
I will kick you both out
of this house.

327
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:51,980
I can't stand the sight of you.
Get out.

328
00:17:55,210 --> 00:17:56,350
And take all this with you.

329
00:17:56,350 --> 00:17:57,610
- What are you doing?
- Right.

330
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:03,650
Return it all and bring me
the receipts.

331
00:18:03,650 --> 00:18:05,060
- Yes, Grandma.
- Yes, Grandma.

332
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,330
Seriously,

333
00:18:08,930 --> 00:18:12,960
how on earth did they raise
these kids?

334
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:16,000
Absolutely pathetic.

335
00:18:30,110 --> 00:18:34,550
- Mother, I'm home. Do you have a...
- Never mind.

336
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:38,520
Mrs. Anseong.

337
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:41,560
- Mrs. Anseong, what are you doing?
- Yes, Madam Chairwoman.

338
00:18:41,630 --> 00:18:43,460
I'll bring in your tea.

339
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:55,010
Hey, you're home.

340
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:56,870
You're late.

341
00:18:58,340 --> 00:19:01,480
Mother paid a surprise visit
to the office today.

342
00:19:02,250 --> 00:19:03,680
I was sweating bullets.

343
00:19:04,350 --> 00:19:06,320
I had some things to wrap up,
so I'm a bit late.

344
00:19:07,550 --> 00:19:10,490
By the way,
why is it so quiet in here?

345
00:19:11,190 --> 00:19:13,290
- Where are Mother and the kids?
- Do Yun and Se Na...

346
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,730
just got an earful from Mother...

347
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:18,430
- and went upstairs.
- Why? What happened?

348
00:19:21,030 --> 00:19:22,270
Let's just go to our room.

349
00:19:22,370 --> 00:19:24,540
It's best if we just
go to sleep quietly tonight, honey.

350
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,440
Come on.

351
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:32,040
Do Yun.

352
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:34,440
What?

353
00:19:36,310 --> 00:19:37,310
I am sorry.

354
00:19:39,050 --> 00:19:40,050
Forget it.

355
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:42,350
It is my fault for giving you
my credit card in the first place.

356
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,260
Did you get in a lot of trouble?

357
00:19:48,690 --> 00:19:50,830
It is fine. I deserved it.

358
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:53,230
I am tired, so I will go rest now.

359
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:55,200
Okay.

360
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,340
Ever since it arrived
from the department store,

361
00:20:05,410 --> 00:20:06,980
I was so nervous.

362
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:10,350
Grandma just happened to be
out in the living room.

363
00:20:13,750 --> 00:20:16,520
Hey, do not be too upset.

364
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:19,160
Since we are all grown up now,
Grandma does not use a switch on us.

365
00:20:19,490 --> 00:20:21,290
You are only saying that because
you did not experience it.

366
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:23,490
I would have rather been hit
with a switch a few times.

367
00:20:24,760 --> 00:20:26,630
When our Grandma gets angry...

368
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:32,040
It is better to eat and drink tea
with the Grim Reaper.

369
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:34,170
But I have a real dilemma now.

370
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:36,170
About what?

371
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:38,540
Se Na, you said you wanted to launch
an underwear brand.

372
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,240
And you asked me to invest in it.

373
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:43,310
But seeing you act
so clueless about the world...

374
00:20:43,650 --> 00:20:45,220
and maxing out credit cards,

375
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:48,050
I do not know
if I should invest in you.

376
00:20:48,490 --> 00:20:51,090
That was just one mistake today.

377
00:20:51,420 --> 00:20:52,890
You need to look
at my designs first, Seung Yun.

378
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:55,560
Wait a second,
I will go get my tablet.

379
00:20:55,830 --> 00:20:56,830
Got it?

380
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:00,660
Gosh.

381
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:14,280
It is a miracle
she did not get kicked out.

382
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,550
Gosh.

383
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:19,480
(K Department Store)

384
00:21:21,420 --> 00:21:22,490
Here it is, Seung Yun.

385
00:21:23,890 --> 00:21:27,420
Without any prejudice,
look at my designs objectively...

386
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:29,460
as the designer Jaden Cha.

387
00:21:31,260 --> 00:21:33,760
Alright. Let us see.

388
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:35,900
Underwear designed by our Se Na...

389
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:43,970
What?

390
00:21:47,540 --> 00:21:48,550
How is it?

391
00:21:48,910 --> 00:21:51,150
Does it not look like
it has investment potential?

392
00:21:58,560 --> 00:21:59,890
How is it?

393
00:22:00,790 --> 00:22:02,460
It is worth investing in, right?

394
00:22:05,430 --> 00:22:06,660
It is surprising,

395
00:22:07,330 --> 00:22:09,130
but these designs, Se Na.

396
00:22:09,470 --> 00:22:10,470
Yes?

397
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,200
Are they really yours?

398
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:14,840
Of course they are mine.

399
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:18,680
You really made
all of these designs?

400
00:22:19,010 --> 00:22:20,010
Yes.

401
00:22:21,140 --> 00:22:23,350
- They are not underwear.
- What?

402
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:28,520
Oh no.

403
00:22:29,250 --> 00:22:30,350
Shoot, this...

404
00:22:31,590 --> 00:22:33,160
This is not mine, Seung Yun.

405
00:22:36,530 --> 00:22:40,400
I must have switched my tablet
with hers at the department store.

406
00:22:42,230 --> 00:22:45,340
Mine has the exact same pattern
as Manager Kang's tablet.

407
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,240
The department store?

408
00:22:48,770 --> 00:22:50,040
Did you just say Manager Kang?

409
00:22:50,610 --> 00:22:51,610
Yes.

410
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:53,680
Kang who?

411
00:22:53,910 --> 00:22:56,050
- Do you know her name?
- Of course I do.

412
00:22:56,110 --> 00:22:59,950
We decided to be like sisters.
Kang Da Mi. Her name is Kang Da Mi.

413
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:03,990
You know, the woman Do Yun
is completely obsessed with.

414
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:08,730
Kang Da Mi?

415
00:23:10,090 --> 00:23:13,030
Then all of these designs,
did she make them?

416
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:15,200
That is what I heard.

417
00:23:15,470 --> 00:23:16,900
She said her dream
is to be a fashion designer.

418
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,400
I see.

419
00:23:20,840 --> 00:23:21,840
Give it to me.

420
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:37,420
- Seung Yun.
- Hold on a second.

421
00:23:40,790 --> 00:23:41,830
What is wrong with him?

422
00:24:03,780 --> 00:24:04,780
This is interesting.

423
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,200
Mom.

424
00:24:21,900 --> 00:24:24,200
I was actually just on my way
out to look for you.

425
00:24:24,670 --> 00:24:25,740
Is everyone gathered?

426
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:28,170
Yes. Grandma said we should start...

427
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:30,770
- in 30 minutes.
- Did you draw the Yut board well?

428
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:33,040
Why would you even ask that?

429
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:34,340
I have done this plenty of times.

430
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:36,180
By the way, Mom,

431
00:24:36,780 --> 00:24:38,580
did you go meet Mi Seon today?

432
00:24:40,050 --> 00:24:42,420
- Yes.
- Mom, do not tell me...

433
00:24:42,620 --> 00:24:44,990
you went there to try
and persuade Mi Seon, did you?

434
00:24:46,490 --> 00:24:49,290
It is spilt milk.
I raised my son poorly,

435
00:24:49,360 --> 00:24:51,330
so what power do my words have
as a mother-in-law?

436
00:24:52,300 --> 00:24:54,830
I just waited
and gave her some side dishes.

437
00:24:55,900 --> 00:24:58,370
I mean, in that tiny rooftop room,

438
00:24:58,440 --> 00:25:00,740
how is she supposed to
start over all by herself?

439
00:25:03,140 --> 00:25:05,080
I went there because I was worried,

440
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:07,740
but Mi Seon actually
tried to teach me.

441
00:25:08,140 --> 00:25:09,550
She was lecturing me.

442
00:25:09,610 --> 00:25:11,850
She told me to think differently
about your oldest brother.

443
00:25:14,820 --> 00:25:16,320
Why are you not saying anything?

444
00:25:17,750 --> 00:25:18,760
Da Mi, even in your eyes,

445
00:25:18,820 --> 00:25:20,890
did I do something so wrong
with how they live?

446
00:25:22,860 --> 00:25:24,790
I worked my fingers to the bone
so they could live without trouble.

447
00:25:24,860 --> 00:25:26,560
My only crime was helping them.

448
00:25:27,360 --> 00:25:28,800
Let us go inside, Mom.

449
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:35,570
Did you
return the scarf for a refund?

450
00:25:36,740 --> 00:25:37,810
I did.

451
00:25:38,340 --> 00:25:39,640
Do you want me
to show you the receipt?

452
00:25:41,080 --> 00:25:42,080
Good job.

453
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:44,810
Do not waste your money
on things like that again.

454
00:25:45,550 --> 00:25:47,450
My daughter stands all day
until her legs swell up...

455
00:25:47,520 --> 00:25:48,650
to earn that money.

456
00:25:49,050 --> 00:25:50,420
I hate seeing you
spend it like that.

457
00:26:00,430 --> 00:26:03,330
If I do nothing, Aunt Ri Ja nags me,

458
00:26:03,870 --> 00:26:06,940
and if I try to do something,
Mom hates it.

459
00:26:08,770 --> 00:26:10,240
I am in such a tough spot.

460
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:13,780
Grandma.

461
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:16,910
My sweet Su Ah.

462
00:26:17,010 --> 00:26:19,120
I would like it if you went to bed
a little early today.

463
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:22,650
I do not want to.
I want to watch the game too.

464
00:26:24,220 --> 00:26:25,220
Okay.

465
00:26:38,230 --> 00:26:39,370
This is...

466
00:26:40,770 --> 00:26:42,840
If I just take my hands off things
for a second...

467
00:26:44,070 --> 00:26:45,180
With so many people in this house,

468
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,310
they just let things pile up
every time.

469
00:26:52,420 --> 00:26:53,420
Mom.

470
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:55,320
Mom.

471
00:26:58,120 --> 00:26:59,320
It was because of him.

472
00:26:59,820 --> 00:27:02,030
I lost my mind when I met
that monster Kang Hak Sung,

473
00:27:02,090 --> 00:27:03,230
all because of him.

474
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:06,130
That is when I thoroughly
started ruining my own life.

475
00:27:07,060 --> 00:27:09,530
Just say one more word to me.

476
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:11,670
Go ahead. Try me.

477
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:13,840
Mom?

478
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:17,370
You are so scary.

479
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:19,280
I haven't even said anything yet,

480
00:27:19,380 --> 00:27:20,740
so why are you glaring at me
so fiercely?

481
00:27:34,990 --> 00:27:37,890
(Mission: Mompossible)

482
00:27:38,090 --> 00:27:40,560
For every round, the loser must
answer whatever the winner asks...

483
00:27:40,630 --> 00:27:42,930
with absolute honesty.

484
00:27:43,100 --> 00:27:45,700
Dae Chi, what kind of trouble
did you get into?

485
00:27:45,840 --> 00:27:47,800
Is it a woman? Or money?

486
00:27:48,140 --> 00:27:49,670
What are you doing?
Before it gets cold,

487
00:27:49,670 --> 00:27:51,810
- you should drink it quickly.
- I am going to eat first.

488
00:27:52,340 --> 00:27:54,740
- Please give me some candy.
- Do you recognize who I am?

489
00:27:55,950 --> 00:27:57,950
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
